  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EMPOWERING COMMUNITIES, BUILDING RESILIENCE&apos;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to enhance the socio-economic conditions of vulnerable and marginalised groups residing in remote mountain areas of Nepal. The main source of occupation and livelihood for the &#xa0;majority of the population in the target area is subsistence agricultural farming, mainly small scale livestock. Due to the low level of agricultural production, the majority of households face acute food shortages for a significant part of the year</narrative>
  </description>
